                    <TabItem><ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"><StackPanel Margin="28"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="积分与充值" /><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" Text="查看当前余额、充值套餐、订单进度和每一笔积分变化。" Margin="0,7,0,20" />
